1065.         scalar delta_D_`i'_global_XX = (N1_`i'_XX_new/(N1_`i'_XX_new+N0_`i'_XX_new))*delta_D_`i'_in_
> XX+(N0_`i'_XX_new/(N1_`i'_XX_new+N0_`i'_XX_new))*delta_D_`i'_out_XX
1066.         }
1067. 
