1545.                         
.                         sum U_Gg_var_pl_`i'_`j'_2_XX
1546.                         scalar var_sum_pla_`i'_`j'_XX=r(sum)/G_XX^2
1547.                         
.                         scalar cov_pl_`i'_`j'_XX = (scalar(var_sum_pla_`i'_`j'_XX) - scalar(se_placebo_`
> i'_XX)^2 - scalar(se_placebo_`j'_XX)^2)/2
1548.         
.                         * Store the results
