1596.                 matrix didmgt_Var_effects[`i',`i']= scalar(se_`i'_XX)^2
1597.         
.                 if `i'<`=l_XX'{
1598.                 forvalue j=`=`i'+1'/`=l_XX'{
1599.                         
.                         * Create variables necessary to compute the covariances
.                         capture drop U_Gg_var_`i'_`j'_XX
1600.                         capture drop U_Gg_var_`i'_`j'_2_XX
1601.                                         
