1608.                         
.                         sum U_Gg_var_`i'_`j'_2_XX
1609.                         scalar var_sum_`i'_`j'_XX=r(sum)/G_XX^2
1610.                         
.                         scalar cov_`i'_`j'_XX = (scalar(var_sum_`i'_`j'_XX) - scalar(se_`i'_XX)^2 - scal
> ar(se_`j'_XX)^2)/2
1611.         
.                         * Store the results
