. if "`bootstrap'"==""&`continuous'>0{
 57.         di as error "You specified the continuous option without the bootstrap option. Please be awar
> e that we recommend to compute bootstraped standard errors when you are using the continuous option as t
> he analytical standard errors can be liberal in that case."        
