> tual coefficient matrix to be used in the ereturn post 
.         foreach u of local levels_d_sq_XX {
1275.                 matrix coefs_sq_bs_`u'_XX = coefs_sq_`u'_XX
1276.         }
1277.         matrix didmgt_bs_results_no_avg_XX=didmgt_results_no_avg_XX // Modif Felix
1278.         
